XFAIL: *

An exception in a script's onCommand ends the session with an error that
names it, instead of hanging or passing silently.
Known failures: #122 (an exception in a script callback hangs the session).

RUN: not %e2e timeout 90 -- %catter %S/Inputs/throw-on-command.js -- %e2e probe nested 2>&1 | FileCheck %s

CHECK: thrown from onCommand
CHECK-NOT: TIMEOUT
